# TokyoNight — ghostty colours.
# Pulled in by ghostty/config via config-file, through ghostty/theme.

# Ghostty ships several TokyoNight variants. This is the plain "TokyoNight"
# one, which differs from "TokyoNight Night" only in cursor-text and
# selection-background, and is what this repo has always used.
theme = tokyonight

# This config used to carry bold-is-bright = true. That key no longer exists in
# Ghostty 1.3.2 -- it is absent from all 300 keys in `ghostty +show-config`, and
# ghostty ignores unknown keys silently rather than failing validation, so the
# setting had quietly stopped doing anything. bold-color is the replacement if
# the effect is ever wanted back.
